# Detection 1 — Brute Force Authentication

## Purpose

Detect source IP addresses that repeatedly fail SSH authentication within a defined period.

### Query

```kusto
MeridianLogs_CL
| where RawData has "Failed password"
| extend SourceIP = extract(@"from ([0-9.]+)",1,RawData)
| summarize FailedAttempts=count() by SourceIP
| where FailedAttempts >= 5
| order by FailedAttempts desc
```

### Example Output

| SourceIP | FailedAttempts |
|----------|---------------:|
|203.0.113.77|28|

### Why It Matters

Multiple failed authentication attempts from the same IP address are commonly associated with brute-force attacks.

