# Production Considerations

Before deploying an Analytics Rule, consider:

- Detection threshold
- Query frequency
- Lookup period
- Alert suppression
- Entity mapping
- False-positive tuning
- Performance optimization

Well-designed detections balance sensitivity with operational efficiency.

---

# Analytics Rule Configuration

| Setting | Recommended Value |
|---------|-------------------|
| Rule Type | Scheduled |
| Query Frequency | Every 5 minutes |
| Lookup Period | Last 1 hour |
| Severity | Medium |
| Trigger | Greater than 0 results |
| Entity Mapping | IP Address |

