# Key Takeaways

- Detection engineering automates the identification of known threats.
- Effective detections begin with well-understood telemetry.
- Threshold tuning is essential to reduce alert fatigue.
- Analytics Rules should be continuously reviewed and improved.
- High-quality detections enable faster and more consistent incident response.
